      "POL-RD-09(4) billing integrity: the SGD 3.20 ERP charge for the 'Bukit Merah Central westbound' gantry is refunded in full as a phantom line — the GPS trace's nearest fix lies 7,482 m from the gantry, far outside the 250 m crossing radius, and the gantry is flagged on_optimal_route false."
